Reservation form for our booking tool. Users report that if they pick a checkout date before check-in, the form just silently flips the dates around and nobody notices. Product wants an actual error shown on the checkout field instead. Fix it please. Schema file:

```ts
// reservationSchema.ts
import { z } from 'zod';

export const reservationSchema = z
  .object({
    guestName: z.string().min(2, 'Name is too short').max(60, 'Name is too long'),
    checkIn: z.string().min(1, 'Check-in required'),
    checkOut: z.string().min(1, 'Check-out required'),
    guests: z.number().min(1).max(8),
  })
  .transform((v) => {
    if (new Date(v.checkOut) < new Date(v.checkIn)) {
      return { ...v, checkIn: v.checkOut, checkOut: v.checkIn };
    }
    return v;
  });

export type ReservationValues = z.infer<typeof reservationSchema>;
```

